    "answer": {
      "short": "$x=32$",
      "worked": "For $x>0$:\n$$\\begin{align*}\\log_4\\left(\\frac{3x}{6}\\right)&=2\\\\\\frac{x}{2}&=4^2\\\\x&=32\\end{align*}$$",
